    "detailed_description": "Originally released in 1987 for the Commodore 64, this return to the world of <i>Bounder</i> saw players once again take on the role of an eternally bouncing tennis ball, travelling over a surreal landscape, but now equipped with powerful weapons and tasked with saving the world from evil aliens! Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Bounce across the world, avoiding dangerous drops and hazards, discovering special tiles that can help or hinder your progress, pick up weapons and powerups, fight deadly aliens, and fight a fearsome floating fortress!<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Originally released in 1987 for the Commodore 64, this return to the world of <i>Bounder</i> saw players once again take on the role of an eternally bouncing tennis ball, travelling over a surreal landscape, but now equipped with powerful weapons and tasked with saving the world from evil aliens! Now, relive those days in this remastered emulated version.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>Bounce across the world, avoiding dangerous drops and hazards, discovering special tiles that can help or hinder your progress, pick up weapons and powerups, fight deadly aliens, and fight a fearsome floating fortress!<br><br><br>This enhanced version introduces a number of modern features to this retro classic, including:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Saving/loading the game at any point<br></li><li> Support for most modern game controllers<br></li><li> Full control remapping<br></li><li> Image scaling and smoothing options</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In this bouncy sequel, released in 1987 for the Commodore 64, take on the role of an eternally bouncing tennis ball once more, travelling over a surreal landscape, but now equipped with powerful weapons and tasked with saving the world from evil aliens!",
